 given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{y}={∬}_{D}{x}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the origin is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{0}={∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A={I}_{x}+{I}_{y}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula for ${I}_{0},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{0} & ={∬}_{D}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{3}({x}^{2}+{y}^{2})(4y+1)\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{0}^{3}4{x}^{2}y+{x}^{2}+4{y}^{3}+{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x]\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[\\frac{4}{3}{x}^{3}y+\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+4x{y}^{3}+x{y}^{2}]}_{x=0}^{x=3}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}36y+9+12{y}^{3}+3{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =[18{y}^{2}+9y+3{y}^{4}+{y}^{3}]_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =18+9+3+1 \\\\  & =31.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the moment of inertia of the lamina about the origin is $31\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}.$" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364371 13194139535742 true] [17592186364370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364372 13194139535742 true] [17592186364370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364373 13194139535742 true] [17592186364370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364374 13194139535742 true] [17592186364370 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364375 13194139535742 true] [17592186364370 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535742 true] [17592186364370 1041 "selection" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364370 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364375 13194139535742 true] [17592186364370 1110 #uuid "fcf48675-2df6-583b-ae44-9be89f0aa298" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364371 1034 "35\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364371 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364371 1111 #uuid "d26df32d-76b1-51df-9db9-495b9ec94532" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364372 1034 "23.5\\,\\text{kg}\\cdot {\\text{m}}^{2}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364372 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364372 1111 #uuid "5da41ef1-88a5-535c-b30e-1ff260fbac75" 1