d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}{\\int }_{0}^{2}3{x}^{2}-\\frac{3}{2}{x}^{3}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}{[{x}^{3}-\\frac{3}{8}{x}^{4}]}_{0}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{3}(8-6) \\\\  & =\\frac{2M}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364434 13194139535742 true] [17592186364433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364435 13194139535742 true] [17592186364433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364436 13194139535742 true] [17592186364433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364437 13194139535742 true] [17592186364433 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364438 13194139535742 true] [17592186364433 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535742 true] [17592186364433 1041 "selection" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364433 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364435 13194139535742 true] [17592186364433 1110 #uuid "5e76fa7e-92b9-5529-9a53-a0882995a30b" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364434 1034 "\\frac{3M}{4}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364434 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364434 1111 #uuid "190d8080-e400-57a6-b5b8-8afabda13574" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364435 1034 "\\frac{2M}{3}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364435 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364435 1111 #uuid "b73bdc1f-af7c-5714-bddb-c368e2f4687a" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364436 1034 "3M" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364436 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364436 1111 #uuid "6d2b9ca3-bc1a-5ff9-adc7-fce2197d707a" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364437 1034 "2M" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364437 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364437 1111 #uuid "da917780-39cd-5928-9fdc-5504eb35b69b" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364438 1034 "\\frac{M}{3}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364438 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364438 1111 #uuid "b32ba64b-9d31-5c48-b895-5c66576bad5c" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364439 1017 #edb/ref 17592186364440 13194139535742 true] [17592186364439 1089 "q-163225" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364439 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535742 true] [17592186364439 1100 "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14069995/assets/d1ef5062d5bc045c1e1f7fa58c513315852f74aa15539c001662b0055583f01b.png)\n\nConsider the plate that occupies the region $D$ enclosed by the polar circles $r=1$ and $r=2$ and the polar rays $\\theta =0$ and $\\theta =\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ in the first quadrant, as shown above. The mass density function of the plate is given by $\\lambda (x,y)=10x.$ Find the moment of inertia of the plate about the origin." 13194139535742 true] [17592186364439 1113 #uuid "92176aef-29a6-58f5-b012-4b4737ad5698" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364439 1145 "For a plane lamina $D$ with mass density function $\\lambda (r,\\theta ),$ we have the following definitions:\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $x$-axis, in polar coordinates, is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{x}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $y$-axis, in polar coordinates, is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{y}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the origin, in polar coordinates, is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{0}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta ={I}_{x}+{I}_{y}.\n$$\n\nFirst, note that the region $D$ in polar coordinates can be expressed as\n\n$$\nD={(r,\\theta )\\,:\\,1\\le r\\le 2,\\,\\,0\\le \\theta \\le \\frac{\\pi }{4}}.\n$$\n\nAlso, the mass density function in polar coordinates is \n\n$$\n\\lambda (r,\\theta )=10r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nTherefore, the moment of inertia about the origin is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{0} & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{\\int }_{1}^{2}10r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\cdot {r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}{\\int }_{1}^{2}10{r}^{4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =({\\int }_{1}^{2}10{r}^{4}\\,\\text{d}r)({\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /4}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta ) \\\\  & =2{r}^{5}\\,{|}_{1}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\,{|}_{0}^{\\pi /4} \\\\  & =2(32-1)(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}-0) \\\\  & =31\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364440 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364441 13194139535742 true] [17592186364440 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364442 13194139535742 true] [17592186364440 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364443 13194139535742 true] [17592186364440 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364444 13194139535742 true] [17592186364440 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364445 13194139535742 true] [17592186364440 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535742 true] [17592186364440 1041 "selection" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364440 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364441 13194139535742 true] [17592186364440 1110 #uuid "1675b19d-6a25-51b5-b3d7-0c1339c6f8fc" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364441 1034 "31\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364441 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364441 1111 #uuid "148b67cd-5e6d-5122-8b85-df375fc39a1b" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364442 1034 "\\frac{15\\sqrt{2}}{2}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364442 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364442 1111 #uuid "1a18306e-b769-5961-943d-ed487a9c6ee5" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364443 1034 "\\frac{21}{2}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364443 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364443 1111 #uuid "123883c4-49ea-51f6-8d86-af36715fefa9" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364444 1034 "23" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364444 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364444 1111 #uuid "6ea984eb-8ee9-50ba-a64c-c051cb0ff9cc" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364445 1034 "5\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364445 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [175