of inertia about the $x$-axis is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{x} & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{2}^{3}\\frac{1}{{r}^{2}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }\\cdot {r}^{3}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2}{\\int }_{2}^{3}r\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =({\\int }_{2}^{3}r\\,\\text{d}r)({\\int }_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2}\\text{d}\\theta ) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}{r}^{2}\\,{|}_{2}^{3}\\cdot \\theta \\,{|}_{\\pi /3}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(9-4)\\cdot (\\frac{\\pi }{2}-\\frac{\\pi }{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 5\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{6} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\pi }{12}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364447 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364448 13194139535742 true] [17592186364447 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364449 13194139535742 true] [17592186364447 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364450 13194139535742 true] [17592186364447 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364451 13194139535742 true] [17592186364447 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364452 13194139535742 true] [17592186364447 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535742 true] [17592186364447 1041 "selection" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364447 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364452 13194139535742 true] [17592186364447 1110 #uuid "69501c94-9cc9-56b3-80cd-aa847b5d3a43" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364448 1034 "\\frac{7\\pi }{10}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364448 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364448 1111 #uuid "0235e39f-4899-563f-b750-9b6144eae62c" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364449 1034 "\\frac{9\\pi }{4}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364449 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364449 1111 #uuid "10549c83-7c09-5681-addb-db839d171f43" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364450 1034 "\\frac{3\\pi }{8}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364450 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364450 1111 #uuid "aba3ea2a-4d17-5950-95f9-b3cf3aa534e0" 1319