sed as\n\n$$\nD={(r,\\theta )\\,:\\,0\\le r\\le 4,\\,\\,0\\le \\theta \\le \\pi }.\n$$\n\nThe area of the plate $D$ is \n\n$$\nA=\\frac{1}{2}\\pi {r}^{2}=8\\pi .\n$$\n\n \n\nSince the mass is distributed uniformly, the mass density function is given by\n\n$$\n\\lambda (r,\\theta )=\\frac{M}{A}=\\frac{M}{8\\pi }.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the moment of inertia about the $y$-axis is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{y} & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{8\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{4}{r}^{3}{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{8\\pi }({\\int }_{0}^{4}{r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r)({\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}\\theta ) \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{8\\pi }({\\int }_{0}^{4}{r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r)({\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\frac{1+\\operatorname{cos}⁡2\\theta }{2}\\,\\text{d}\\theta ) \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{8\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}{r}^{4}{|}_{0}^{4}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{2}\\theta +\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡2\\theta ){|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{M}{8\\pi }\\cdot 64\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{2} \\\\  & =4M.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364454 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364455 13194139535742 true] [17592186364454 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364456 13194139535742 true] [17592186364454 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364457 13194139535742 true] [17592186364454 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364458 13194139535742 true] [17592186364454 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364459 13194139535742 true] [17592186364454 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535742 true] [17592186364454 1041 "selection" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364454 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364458 13194139535742 true] [17592186364454 1110 #uuid "d0d8985c-4b56-598b-8540-4e41803354e1" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364455 1034 "\\frac{M}{2}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364455 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364455 1111 #uuid "78e07db8-b668-530c-942c-fe79553c39e4" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364456 1034 "M" 1