1145 "For a plane lamina $D$ with mass density function $\\lambda (r,\\theta ),$ we have the following definitions:\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $x$-axis, in polar coordinates, is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{x}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the $y$-axis, in polar coordinates, is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{y}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta \\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta .\n$$\n\n- The moment of inertia about the origin, in polar coordinates, is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{0}={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta ={I}_{x}+{I}_{y}.\n$$\n\nFirst, notice that the region $D,$ in polar coordinates, can be expressed as\n\n$$\nD={(r,\\theta )\\,:\\,1\\le r\\le 2,\\,\\,0\\le \\theta \\le \\pi }.\n$$\n\nFrom the description, the mass density function can be written as $\\lambda (r,\\theta )=k{r}^{2},$ where $k$ is a constant of proportionality. We can find an expression for $k$ in terms of $M$ by integrating the density function over the plate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot r\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }k{r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}\\theta \\,\\text{d}r \\\\  & =k({\\int }_{1}^{2}{r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r)({\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\,\\text{d}\\theta ) \\\\  & =k\\cdot \\frac{{r}^{4}}{4}{|}_{1}^{2}\\cdot \\theta {|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =k\\cdot \\frac{15}{4}\\cdot \\pi  \\\\  & =\\frac{15k\\pi }{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence,\n\n$$\n\\lambda (r,\\theta )=k{r}^{2}=\\frac{4M{r}^{2}}{15\\pi }.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the moment of inertia about the origin is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{0} & ={∬}_{D}\\lambda (r,\\theta )\\cdot {r}^{3}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{4M}{15\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{1}^{2}{r}^{5}\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{4M}{15\\pi }({\\int }_{1}^{2}{r}^{5}\\,\\text{d}r)({\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }\\,\\text{d}\\theta ) \\\\  & =\\frac{4M}{15\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{1}{6}{r}^{6}{|}_{1}^{2}\\cdot \\theta {|}_{0}^{\\pi } \\\\  & =\\frac{4M}{15\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{1}{6}(64-1)\\cdot (\\pi -0) \\\\  & =\\frac{14M}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364468 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364469 13194139535742 true] [17592186364468 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364470 13194139535742 true] [17592186364468 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364471 13194139535742 true] [17592186364468 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364472 13194139535742 true] [17592186364468 1000 #edb/ref 17592186364473 13194139535742 true] [17592186364468 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535742 true] [17592186364468 1041 "selection" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364468 1104 #edb/ref 17592186364473 13194139535742 true] [17592186364468 1110 #uuid "e3a5a1e2-77d8-517c-8d3d-504629e93b24" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364469 1034 "6M" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364469 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364469 1111 #uuid "cc6a82bb-4c72-5958-80ae-6f77875da8a8" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364470 1034 "\\frac{28M}{5}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364470 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364470 1111 #uuid "9bc6b333-2f93-5fb7-b376-4e22cd854b78" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364471 1034 "\\frac{16M}{3}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364471 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364471 1111 #uuid "39097f3b-e339-56c3-85ea-b1455eeb433e" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364472 1034 "\\frac{21M}{4}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364472 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364472 1111 #uuid "b90b5a0a-3df5-5d31-a16f-a7ebaa95c490" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364473 1034 "\\frac{14M}{5}" 13194139535742 true] [17592186364473 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535742 true] [17592186364473 1111 #uuid "3658ca36-08d0-5e0f-bafc-20ab62d9bb6f" 13194139535742 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-162905/selection/ma-v1/711899b6c37344fc1f553420bdb5621cbadae37b2b7d4353030efe2acd4b9850" 1